  "body": "The keyway envelope check does not assert the rest.\n\n## Evidence\n\nIn the merged #3650 head, `crates/motion/src/machining2d/rotary_parallel_keyway.rs:106` filters the envelope verdict by gouge (less than or equal to 0.05) and by keyway location, but not by `rest_mm`. The \"only the corner rest\" claim would also hold with a large rest.\n\n## What to do\n\nAdd the `rest_mm` bound to that filter, and a case that fails on a large rest.\n\n## Related\n\n- #3650: the merge that carries the check.\n",
